## Installation

```console
helm repo add kube-node-role-label https://dntosas.github.io/kube-node-role-label/
helm repo update
helm upgrade --install kube-node-role-label kube-node-role-label/kube-node-role-label \
  --namespace kube-utils --create-namespace \
  --set label_watch.labels=karpenter.sh/nodepool
```

## Logging

The controller logs structured JSON by default (`logFormat: json`). At the
default `logLevel: info` a cluster that is already fully labelled produces no
output at all; each added role is logged exactly once. Set `logLevel: debug`
to see every node visited.

